          <h5 class="mt-3 fw-bold">Academic Skills</h5>
          <ul class="list-unstyled">
            <li>Research & Lab Work</li>
            <li>Scientific Writing</li>
            <li>Data Interpretation</li>
            <li>Statistical Analysis</li>
          </ul>

          <h5 class="mt-3 fw-bold">Professional Skills</h5>
          <ul class="list-unstyled">
            <li>Communication</li>
            <li>Teamwork</li>
            <li>Organization</li>
            <li>Bilingual Spanish/English</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Interests -->
    <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12">
      <!-- custom mouse hover effect applied to card -->
      <div class="card h-100">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h2 class="card-title text-center mb-3">Interests</h2>
          <p>
            Outside of academics, I enjoy listening to music (house, R&B, bossa nova,
            classical, and alternative), watching movies, and playing table games
            like Gin, Golf, Cambio, and Rummikub. I also enjoy hiking and traveling
